et="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam store ↗</a> <button class="btn" id="saveBtn" type="button" title="Saved in this browser only">☆ Save</button> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn" type="button">Share</button> </div> <dl class="facts"> <div><dt>Steam App ID</dt><dd><code>5316540</code><button class="copy" id="copyId" type="button">Copy</button></dd></div> <div><dt>Developer</dt><dd>Over The Moon Games</dd></div> <div><dt>Publisher</dt><dd>Over The Moon Games</dd></div> <div><dt>Release date</dt><dd>Oct 23, 2026</dd></div> <div><dt>Price</dt><dd>¥ 26.00</dd></div> <div><dt>Platforms</dt><dd>Windows</dd></div> <div><dt>Genres</dt><dd>Casual / Simulation</dd></div> <div><dt>Tags</dt><dd>单人、Steam 成就、部分支持控制器、家庭共享</dd></div>   <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd class="clamp">英语 * , 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 阿拉伯语, 保加利亚语, 捷克语, 丹麦语, 荷兰语, 芬兰语, 希腊语, 匈牙利语, 印度尼西亚语, 日语, 韩语, 马来语, 挪威语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 葡萄牙语 - 葡萄牙, 罗马尼亚语, 俄语, 简体中文, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 瑞典语, 泰语, 繁体中文, 土耳其语, 乌克兰语, 越南语 * 具有完全音频支持的语言</dd></div>   </dl> </aside> </section> <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="On this page"> <a href="#ai">AI use</a> <a href="#evidence">Evidence</a> <a href="#steam">Steam data</a> <a href="#developer">Developer</a> <a href="#sources">Sources &amp; corrections</a> </nav> <section class="section" id="ai"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">AI USE</div><h2>Eight areas, separate answers</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">3 / 8 areas with reported AI use</div> </div> <div class="status-note tone-amber"> <strong>Official AI disclosure</strong><span>The developer has disclosed generative AI use. The original source defines its scope.</span> </div> <p class="section-lede">A Halloween shop tidying simulation released on Oct 23, 2026. The developer states that generative AI was used across all disciplines of development, most often with heavy human editing, and names audio, visual art, 3D models, the logo and localization, adding that the whole soundtrack of 1950s-style Halloween pop hits is AI generated.</p>  <div class="table-wrap"> <table class="ai-table"> <thead> <tr><th>Area</th><th>Scope</th><th>Status</th><th>Notes</th></tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>In-game generation</strong><small>In-game AI</small></td> <td class="muted">Content generated during play</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Code</strong><small>Code</small></td> <td class="muted">Programming and development</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Art</strong><small>Art</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Visual assets</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The disclosure names visual art, 3D models and the game&#39;s logo as made with generative AI, with the developer stating the tools were used across all disciplines of development and that outputs went through heavy human editing.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Music &amp; sound</strong><small>Music &amp; SFX</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Music and sound</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The developer states that the entire soundtrack of 1950s-style Halloween pop hits is AI generated and that this is audible in the trailer, and the same disclosure lists audio among the disciplines using generative AI.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Voice</strong><small>Voice</small></td> <td class="muted">Voice and dialogue audio</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Writing</strong><small>Writing</small></td> <td class="muted">Story and written content</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Translation</strong><small>Translation</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Translation and localization</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The same sentence lists localization among the areas where generative AI was used; the disclosure does not say which languages, how much, or how the output was reviewed.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Marketing</strong><small>Marketing</small></td> <td class="muted">Promotional material</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="legend"> <span><i class="dot used"></i>Reported use (official / third-party)</span> <span><i class="dot not_stated"></i>Not stated (not proof of no use)</span> <span><i class="dot claimed_none"></i>Developer claims no AI</span> <span><i class="dot unreviewed"></i>Unreviewed</span> </div> <blockquote class="quote"> <p>“We use generative AI across all disciplines of game development, most often with heavy amounts of human editing. That involves audio and visual art, 3D models, our logo, and localization. We use it as a productivity tool so we can achieve a higher level of quality, faster, than we would have been able to. We also have a full soundtrack of 1950&#39;s halloween pop hits that are obviously made by AI, as you can hear in the trailer. It&#39;s awesome and it&#39;d be basically impossible otherwise.”</p> <footer>Steam 商店 AI 生成内容披露栏完整原文，2026-11-03 核查；可能随商店页更新。 · <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5316540/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original ↗</a></footer> </blockquote> <details class="callout"> <summary><strong>How to interpret these statuses</strong></summary> <p>Reported AI use: 3/8. Developer no-use claims: 0/8. Claims are not independent verification; not stated does not mean no AI use.</p> </details> <p class="source-line"> Primary source:<a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5316540/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official disclosure ↗</a> <span> · Reviewed 2026-11-03</span> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="evidence"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE</div><h2>Evidence</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">5 sources</div> </div> <div class="timeline"> <article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Official disclosure</span> <time>2026-11-03</time> </div> <h3>Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</h3> <p>We use generative AI across all disciplines of game development, most often with heavy amounts of human editing. That involves audio and visual art, 3D models, our logo, and localization. We use it as a productivity tool so we can achieve a higher level of quality, faster, than we would have been able to. We also have a full soundtrack of 1950&#39;s halloween pop hits that are obviously made by AI, as you can hear in the trailer. It&#39;s awesome and it&#39;d be basically impossible otherwise.</p> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5316540/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Steam discussion index</span> <time>2026-11-03</time> </div> <h3>Steam 讨论区首页核查</h3> <p>英文讨论区首页显示 15 个主题（总数 64）；仅覆盖首页。</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5316540/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Community report</span> <time>2026-11-03</time> </div> <h3>AI trash</h3> <p>When will developers realise we don&#39;t want anything to do with AI in games. You wanna make a game? Put in the effort and do it all yourself, or find someone who can. It&#39;s just lazy, stop taking shortcuts. Hex: Baby Legion View Profile View Posts 4 2 Oct 24 @ 4:18am Report this post No one cares? Dont blame the future for your personal failure #1 Christina View Profile View Posts 3 2 Oct 24 @ 4:49am Report this post i ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ love it, im vibing with the music. not everyone can afford to buy songs from bands you know? #2 Александра View Profile View Posts Oct 24 @ 5:38am Report this post nah it&#39;s much better than the other ai slop tidy up games, I can see some effort put in this #3 LadyIndiga View Profile View Posts 7 4 3 Oct 24 @ 6:47am Report this post Originally posted by PupZival : When will developers realise we don&#39;t want anything to do with AI in games. There is no &#39;we&#39;. You might not want anything to do with AI in games (although your wording and tone scream performance, not conscientious objection) but I don&#39;t care about AI use, backend or upfront, gen or other. I care about a fun game and this one is adorable. So your statement is false. You want perform anti-AI sentiment? Put in the effort and make a rational argument instead of presumming to speak for people you don&#39;t know. It&#39;s just lazy, stop taking shortcuts. Oh, and keep harrassing devs over disclosed AI use and don&#39;t be surprised when Steam rolls back on mandating it be disclosed and bans any discussion of it. #4 Jinxy Jester View Profile View Posts 2 Oct 24 @ 10:31am Report this post Originally posted by PupZival : When will developers realise we don&#39;t want anything to do with AI in games. You wanna make a game? Put in the effort and do it all yourself, or find someone who can. It&#39;s just lazy, stop taking shortcuts. 100% agree they can literally get royalty free songs #5 BlueCat View Profile View Posts 2 1 Oct 24 @ 11:48am Report this post People paying money for this trash are the problem. You&#39;re just enabling developers to be more lazy and crank out more garbage. #6 Starburst View Profile View Posts 3 2 Oct 24 @ 2:37pm Report this post The game is like $5. The developer put a lot of effort imo. I love the vibe of this game, the music is perfect. Not everyone has a problem with AI being used. To the developer: Beautiful job! Other Tidy Up games are reusing all the same items for their stores. This was completely different. #7 Poof View Profile View Posts 2 1 1 Oct 24 @ 5:48pm Report this post Originally posted by BlueCat : People paying money for this trash are the problem. You&#39;re just enabling developers to be more lazy and crank out more garbage. I can&#39;t speak for everybody, but I don&#39;t personally consult a bunch of pearl-clutching, virtue-signaling, performative strangers on Steam before I spend my hard-earned money. #8 77bsn77 View Profile View Posts Oct 24 @ 9:23pm Report this post Personnally I don&#39;t care about AI at all. Always suprised by the militants crying about it in every discussion page. Who cares ? #9 crztrucker57 View Profile View Posts Oct 24 @ 10:18pm Report this post WTF difference does it make if they use AI or not? I don&#39;t see you creating anything but hate on every game forum that has anything to do with AI? Are you a game designer out of a job, I don&#39;t think so, are you an artist in need of work? I don&#39;t think so. So keep your nasty remarks about AI to yourself. You and so many other losers have tried to ruin games for all the rest of us because you are living in the 90s, not the 2020s!! #10 REDIC View Profile View Posts Oct 24 @ 10:59pm Report this post Love to pump out low quality slop to cash in on a trend. Thats what game dev is all about! #11 Skull Merchant&#39;s Wife View Profile View Posts Oct 24 @ 11:06pm Report this post You people literally cannot be pleased. You screamed for AI disclosure and this Dev very clearly disclosed every single part of their game they used AI to assist with. Do you want them to disclose it or not? You&#39;re just going to make other Devs hide their use because of this ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥, childish behavior. You bought a game that disclosed AI use just to cry about the AI use? Or, worse yet, you&#39;re critiquing a game you never even played. To the Dev: You made an incredible game that many of us truly enjoyed. Don&#39;t listen to these people. #12 EQOAnostalgia View Profile View Posts Oct 25 @ 12:31am Report this post Let them have their slop games. #13 LadyIndiga View Profile View Posts Oct 25 @ 12:47am Report this post Originally posted by EQOAnostalgia : Let them have their slop games. Like you have an authority to stop it. I get it, the future is scary. But being angry about it and taking out that anger on a small business isn&#39;t going to make anything better and just makes you look bitter and sad. #14 LadyIndiga View Profile View Posts Oct 25 @ 12:51am Report this post Originally posted by Skull Merchant&#39;s Wife : You people literally cannot be pleased. We have been here before. Hopefully people will remember that and not bother trying past basic courtesy. #15</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5316540/discussions/0/563671642446777055/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Community report</span> <time>2026-11-03</time> </div> <h3>Non-stop AI SLOP!</h3> <p>The &quot;clean up and organize&quot; genre is a cesspool of garbage. Poof View Profile View Posts 3 1 Oct 24 @ 5:59pm Report this post And you think bullying developers and players is going to change anything? Believe it or not, there are other people in this world besides you and thousands of us want this genre. I&#39;m sure you&#39;re into a lot of things I would think are garbage, but that&#39;s your business. #1 Frosty View Profile View Posts Oct 24 @ 8:56pm Report this post Okay and? You dont like it?, dont buy it or play it. I&#39;d rather play something AI like this then the slop of AAA studios (Cough cough COD) #2 crztrucker57 View Profile View Posts 1 Oct 24 @ 10:20pm Report this post WTF difference does it make if they use AI or not? I don&#39;t see you creating anything but hate on every game forum that has anything to do with AI? Are you a game designer out of a job, I don&#39;t think so, are you an artist in need of work? I don&#39;t think so. So keep your nasty remarks about AI to yourself. You and so many other losers have tried to ruin games for all the rest of us because you are living in the 90s, not the 2020s!! #3 EQOAnostalgia View Profile View Posts 1 1 Oct 25 @ 12:30am Report this post Originally posted by Poof : And you think bullying developers and players is going to change anything? Believe it or not, there are other people in this world besides you and thousands of us want this genre. I&#39;m sure you&#39;re into a lot of things I would think are garbage, but that&#39;s your business. Yes... which is why we do it lol. #4 Aussiebeast View Profile View Posts 1 1 1 Oct 25 @ 10:19pm Report this post Just start reporting these weirdos for targetted harrassment. #5 Pugs View Profile View Posts 1 Oct 26 @ 4:36pm Report this post I am just checking the game out for the first time and idk....you guys know the forums are for feedback, right? AI is a controversial topic and people can voice their opinions, whether you, me, or anyone agrees. #6 VenomKisses View Profile View Posts 1 Oct 26 @ 6:07pm Report this post I&#39;m not interested in the opinions of anti-AI folks. Not sorry about it either. #7 UselessFoetus View Profile View Posts Oct 26 @ 7:18pm Report this post the game is good, get with the times buddy. #8 Megatronica View Profile View Posts 1 Oct 26 @ 8:19pm Report this post So much water and human talent wasted. I will fight AI till the day I die. Try having a data center in your backyard; the pollution, NONSTOP HIGH DECIBEL SOUNDS and higher utility costs for the residents. Not to mention, no one actually benefits from the presence of data centers in their communities. Enjoy your game, folks. Truly. #9 VenomKisses View Profile View Posts Oct 27 @ 6:11am Report this post AI isn&#39;t the only thing or even the worst thing that uses data centers. Are you willing to give up those other things as well? Go on a crusade about them? Want to go on a crusade against water usage instead? You&#39;ll have to go vegan. The animal industry is the BIGGEST water drain on the planet by a lot. Here’s the relative impact to our environment of common digital activities: YouTube or Netflix, 1 hour (HD) ~0.12 kWh → 42 g CO₂ Tied for the dirtiest single activity in the study. Text-to-video generation, 6–10 seconds ~0.05 kWh → 17.5 g CO₂ Roughly the same as an hour-long Zoom call. Zoom, 1 hour ~0.0486 kWh → 17 g CO₂ Short email, no attachment ~0.0133 kWh → 4.7 g CO₂ One email is tiny, billions per day are not. AI image generation, 1 image ~0.003 kWh → 1 g CO₂ Voice assistant query (Alexa/Siri/etc.) ~0.0005 kWh → 0.175 g CO₂ Google search or AI chatbot prompt ~0.0003 kWh → 0.105 g CO₂ Two Gemini prompts ~0.00024 kWh → 0.084 g CO₂ total (~0.042 per prompt) Most anti-AI people just don&#39;t know what they&#39;re talking about. That&#39;s why I don&#39;t care about their opinions or their judgment. #10 Pugs View Profile View Posts Oct 27 @ 10:55am Report this post Originally posted by VenomKisses : I&#39;m not interested in the opinions of anti-AI folks. Not sorry about it either. :tabbycat: Well, you are going to have a hard time over the next few years. The discussions on AI are only going to get more intense as it causes more disturbances in the workforce. You can have your opinion, but you certainly can&#39;t suppress other people&#39;s opinions. #11 evelessence View Profile View Posts Oct 28 @ 2:22am Report this post Originally posted by Poof : And you think bullying developers and players is going to change anything? Believe it or not, there are other people in this world besides you and thousands of us want this genre. I&#39;m sure you&#39;re into a lot of things I would think are garbage, but that&#39;s your business. does putting a tv dinner in the microwave make you a chef? Last edited by evelessence ; Oct 28 @ 2:23am #12</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5316540/discussions/0/563671642446830015/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Third-party source</span> <time>2026-11-03</time> </div> <h3>AI Transparency Index 复刻本作商店披露的分析页</h3> <p>Generative AI was used across multiple disciplines including visual art, audio, 3D models, logo, and localization, with heavy human editing.</p> <a href="https://aitransparencyindex.com/products/steam/5316540" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article> </div> <details class="callout"><summary><strong>Review notes (expand)</strong></summary><p>Reviewed the full English Steam AI disclosure, the identity (developer Over The Moon Games, self-published) and the English discussion homepage (15 visible topics of 64), where two topics directly concern AI use; both threads were opened and read in full. They are player arguments about AI in games, one asking the developer not to use AI and replies defending it and enjoying the AI music, the other attacking AI content in the tidy-up genre. Both are opinions and second-hand statements, so they are logged without changing any area finding. This title was searched 1 time with 6 results and 1 raw source was read: an AI Transparency Index page reproducing the store disclosure with a model-scored confidence figure, which is a transcription and not independent verification. The remaining results were store pages for this game and for a different tidy-up title, a Reddit board page that returned no readable body and a price aggregator. Every area finding comes from the store disclosure text itself and rests on the developer&#39;s own statement, without an independent audit. The disclosure claims every discipline while only itemising audio, visual art, 3D models, the logo and localization, so code, voice, writing, marketing and in-game generation are recorded as not addressed rather than as non-use.</p></details> </section> <section class="section" id="steam"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">STEAM DATA</div><h2>Steam data</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Public data snapshot</div> </div> <div class="stat-grid"> <div class="stat"> <span>Online now</span> <strong>86</strong> <small>Steam public API</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Steam reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>No data</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Positive reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>All languages</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Release date</span> <strong>2026</strong> <small>Oct 23, 2026</small> </div> </div> <div class="steam-desc"><h3>Steam description</h3><p>不知是什么东西把这家温馨的万圣节小店弄得一团糟。把南瓜、魔法药水和糖果放回原位，找出奇特的线索，结识一位神秘的新朋友。这是一款轻松的第一人称整理游戏，带着一点淘气的趣味。</p></div> <p class="source-line"> Player and review figures are Steam snapshots taken at build time and may be delayed. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5316540/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View current data on Steam ↗</a> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="developer"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER</div><h2>Developer</h2></div></div> <div class="dev-card"> <div class="dev-avatar">OV</div> <div class="dev-body"> <h3>Over The Moon Games</h3> <p>Developer / publisher</p> <div class="dev-links">  <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/search/?developer=Over%20The%20Moon%20Games" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developer on Steam ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Tidy%20Up%20the%20Halloween%20Shop%EF%BC%885316540%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5316540-tidy-up-the-halloween-shop%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claim / correct ↗</a> </div> </div> </div>  </section> <section class="section" id="community"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</div><h2>Player impressions</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Separate from official disclosures</div> </div> <p class="section-lede">Player impressions are not evidence of AI use. Votes do not change developer disclosure findings.</p> <form id="voteForm" class="vote-form"> <select id="voteSelect" required aria-label="Choose your impression"> <option value="">Your impression…</option> <option value="no_ai_suspected">I suspect no AI use</option> <option value="some_ai_suspected">I suspect some AI use</option> <option value="heavy_ai_suspected">I suspect extensive AI use</option> <option value="all_ai_suspected">I suspect AI throughout</option> </select> <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Submit</button> </form> <p id="voteMessage" class="muted" role="status"></p> <div id="voteCounts" class="vote-counts"></div> <p class="source-line">Feedback availability does not affect the evidence. One vote per network per game.</p> </section> <section class="section" id="sources"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">SOURCES</div><h2>Sources &amp; review limits</h2></div></div> <ul class="source-list"> <li> <span>Official disclosure</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5316540/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</a> <time>2026-11-03</time> </li><li> <span>Steam discussion index</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5316540/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 讨论区首页核查</a> <time>2026-11-03</time> </li><li> <span>Community report</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5316540/discussions/0/563671642446777055/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI trash</a> <time>2026-11-03</time> </li><li> <span>Community report</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5316540/discussions/0/563671642446830015/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Non-stop AI SLOP!</a> <time>2026-11-03</time> </li><li> <span>Third-party source</span> <a href="https://aitransparencyindex.com/products/steam/5316540" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI Transparency Index 复刻本作商店披露的分析页</a> <time>2026-11-03</time> </li> <li> <span>Steam store</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5316540/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tidy Up the Halloween Shop · App 5316540</a> <time></time> </li> </ul> <div class="callout"> <strong>Found an error?</strong> <p> Please include an original source, date and specific correction. <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Tidy%20Up%20the%20Halloween%20Shop%EF%BC%885316540%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5316540-tidy-up-the-halloween-shop%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Suggest a correction ↗</a> or <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Tidy%20Up%20the%20Halloween%20Shop%20%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a GitHub issue ↗</a>。
</p> </div> </section> <div class="share-bar"> <span>Share this game</span> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn2" type="button">Copy link</button> <a class="btn" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Does%20Tidy%20Up%20the%20Halloween%20Shop%20use%20AI%3F&url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5316540-tidy-up-the-halloween-shop%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Share on X</a> <a class="btn" href="https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5316540-tidy-up-the-halloween-shop%2F&title=Tidy%20Up%20the%20Halloween%20Shop%20%E2%80%94%20AI%20use%20evidence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Reddit</a> </div> </main> <div class="tf-cta-wrap"><a class="tf-cta" href="https://toolfavor.com/?utm_source=gameaichecker&utm_medium=footer_button" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3l1.9 4.6L18.5 9.5l-4.6 1.9L12 16l-1.9-4.6L5.5 9.5l4.6-1.9z"></path><path d="M19 15l.8 1.9 1.9.8-1.9.8L19 20.4l-.8-1.9-1.9-.8 1.9-.8z"></path></svg><span>Discover more useful tools on ToolFavor</span><svg class="tf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="wrap"> <span>Game AI Checker · Independent of Valve / Steam.</span> <span>Evidence first · Not stated does not mean unused</span> </div> </footer> <dialog class="lightbox" id="lightbox"> <button id="closeLightbox" type="button" aria-label="Close">×</button> <img id="lightboxImg" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"> <div class="lightbox-caption" id="lightboxCaption"></div> </dialog> <script>
    (() => {
      const app = document.getElementById('app');
      const labels = JSON.parse(app?.dataset.ui || '{}');
      const tx = key => labels[key] || key;
      const en = document.documentElement.lang === 'en';
      const key = app?.dataset.gameKey || '';
      const slug = app?.dataset.slug || '';

      document.querySelectorAll('img[data-fallback]').forEach((img) => {
        const fallback = img.dataset.fallback;
        if (!fallback) return;
        img.addEventListener('error', function onError() {
          img.removeEventListener('error', onError);
          img.dataset.fallback = '';
          img.src = fallback;
          img.addEventListener('error', () => { img.style.display = 'none'; }, { once: true });
        });
      });

      const heroImg = document.getElementById('heroImg');
      const heroMedia = document.getElementById('heroMedia');
      const thumbs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.thumb'));
      const counter = document.getElementById('mediaCount');
      const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pauseBtn');
      let index = 0;
      let paused = false;
      let hovering = false;
      let timer = null;

      const warmedImages = new Set();
      function warm(full) {
        if (!full || warmedImages.has(full)) return null;
        warmedImages.add(full);
        const image = new Image();
        image.decoding = 'async';
        image.src = full;
        return image;
      }
      // Browse one frame ahead so the lightbox never waits on a cold round trip.
      function warmAround() {
        if (!thumbs.length) return;
        const upcoming = [thumbs[index], thumbs[(index + 1) % thumbs.length]];
        const run = () => upcoming.forEach((thumb) => thumb && warm(thumb.dataset.full));
        if (typeof window.requestIdleCallback === 'function') window.requestIdleCallback(run, { timeout: 1500 });
        else setTimeout(run, 500);
      }

      function show(next) {
        if (!heroImg || !thumbs.length) return;
        index = (next + thumbs.length) % thumbs.length;
        const thumb = thumbs[index];
        heroImg.src = thumb.dataset.src || heroImg.src;
        heroImg.dataset.full = thumb.dataset.full || heroImg.dataset.full;
        thumbs.forEach((item, position) => item.classList.toggle('active', position === index));
        if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
        warmAround();
      }

      function schedule() {
        clearInterval(timer);
        if (thumbs.length < 2 || paused || hovering || document.hidden) return;
        timer = setInterval(() => show(index + 1), 6000);
      }

      thumbs.forEach((thumb) => {
        thumb.addEventListener('click', () => {
          show(Number(thumb.dataset.index || 0));
          schedule();
        });
      });

      document.getElementById('prevBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index - 1); schedule(); });
      document.getElementById('nextBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index + 1); schedule(); });
      pauseBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        paused = !paused;
        pauseBtn.textContent = paused ? '▶' : 'Ⅱ';
        pauseBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', paused ? tx("继续轮播") : tx("暂停轮播"));
        schedule();
      });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { hovering = true; schedule(); });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { hovering = false; schedule(); });
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', schedule);
      schedule();

      const appId = app?.dataset.appid;
      if (appId && heroImg && !heroImg.getAttribute('src')?.startsWith('/images/steam/')) {
        fetch(`/api/steam-media?id=${encodeURIComponent(appId)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            if (!data?.available) return;
            for (const shot of data.screenshots || []) {
              const src = shot.thumbnail || shot.full;
              const full = shot.full || shot.thumbnail;
              if (!src || thumbs.some((thumb) => thumb.dataset.full === full)) continue;
              const thumb = document.createElement('button');
              thumb.className = 'thumb';
              thumb.type = 'button';
              thumb.dataset.src = src;
              thumb.dataset.full = full;
              thumb.dataset.index = String(thumbs.length);
              thumb.setAttribute('aria-label', `第 ${thumbs.length + 1} 张图片`);
              const image = document.createElement('img');
              image.src = src;
              image.alt = '';
              image.loading = 'lazy';
              image.decoding = 'async';
              thumb.append(image);
              thumb.addEventListener('click', () => { show(Number(thumb.dataset.index)); schedule(); });
              document.getElementById('thumbs')?.append(thumb);
              thumbs.push(thumb);
            }
            if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
            const countText = document.getElementById('mediaCountText');
            if (countText) countText.textContent = `${thumbs.length} ${en ? 'official images' : '张官方图片'}`;
            schedule();

            if (data.movies?.length) {
              const mediaCol = document.querySelector('.media-col');
              let videos = document.querySelector('.videos');
              if (!videos && mediaCol) {
                videos = document.createElement('div');
                videos.className = 'videos';
                videos.innerHTML = '<div class="mini-title"></div><div class="video-grid"></div>';
                videos.querySelector('.mini-title').textContent = tx('宣传视频');
                mediaCol.append(videos);
              }
              const grid = videos?.querySelector('.video-grid');
              if (grid) {
                const first = data.movies.find((movie) => movie.webm || movie.mp4);
                if (first) {
                  const player = document.createElement('video');
                  player.className = 'trailer';
                  player.controls = true;
                  player.preload = 'none';
                  player.poster = first.thumbnail || '';
                  player.src = first.webm || first.mp4;
                  grid.before(player);
                }
                for (const movie of data.movies.slice(0, 4)) {
                  if (!movie.thumbnail) continue;
                  const link = document.createElement('a');
                  link.className = 'video-card';
                  link.href = data.steamUrl || `https://store.steampowered.com/app/${appId}/`;
                  link.target = '_blank';
                  link.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
                  const poster = document.createElement('img');
                  poster.src = movie.thumbnail;
                  poster.alt = movie.name || tx("宣传视频");
                  poster.loading = 'lazy';
                  const label = document.createElement('span');
                  label.textContent = `${movie.name || tx("观看宣传视频")} ↗`;
                  link.append(poster, label);
                  grid.append(link);
                }
              }
            }
          })
          .catch(() => {});
      }

      const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
      const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightboxImg');
      const lightboxCaption = document.getElementById('lightboxCaption');
      function openLightbox() {
        if (!heroImg || !lightbox || !lightboxImg) return;
        const full = heroImg.dataset.full || heroImg.src;
        // The 1280 hero frame is already decoded, so the dialog shows at once and upgrades in place.
        lightboxImg.src = heroImg.currentSrc || heroImg.src;
        lightboxImg.alt = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (lightboxCaption) lightboxCaption.textContent = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (typeof lightbox.showModal === 'function') lightbox.showModal();
        const larger = warm(full);
        if (larger) larger.onload = () => { lightboxImg.src = larger.src; };
      }
      document.getElementById('openLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      heroImg?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      [document.getElementById('openLightbox'), heroMedia].forEach((node) => node?.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => warm(heroImg?.dataset.full), { once: true }));
      document.getElementById('closeLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', () => lightbox?.close());
      lightbox?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { if (event.target === lightbox) lightbox.close(); });

      const saveBtn = document.getElementById('saveBtn');
      const starKey = `gac:star:${slug}`;
      function paintStar() {
        if (!saveBtn) return;
        const active = localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1';
        saveBtn.textContent = active ? tx("★ 已收藏") : tx("☆ 收藏");
        saveBtn.classList.toggle('active', active);
      }
      saveBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1') localStorage.removeItem(starKey);
        else localStorage.setItem(starKey, '1');
        paintStar();
      });
      paintStar();

      async function copyLink() {
        const url = window.location.href;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(url);
          flash(tx("链接已复制"));
        } catch {
          window.prompt(tx("复制链接"), url);
        }
      }
      function flash(message) {
        const target = document.getElementById('voteMessage') || document.getElementById('shareBtn');
        if (!target) return;
        const original = target.textContent;
        if (target.id === 'voteMessage') {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = original; }, 2200);
        } else {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = tx("分享"); }, 2200);
        }
      }
      async function share() {
        if (navigator.share) {
          try {
            await navigator.share({ title: document.title, url: window.location.href });
            return;
          } catch {}
        }
        copyLink();
      }
      document.getElementById('shareBtn')?.addEventListener('click', share);
      document.getElementById('shareBtn2')?.addEventListener('click', copyLink);

      document.getElementById('copyId')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        const id = app?.dataset.appid;
        if (!id) return;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(id);
          flash(tx("App ID 已复制"));
        } catch {}
      });

      const voteForm = document.getElementById('voteForm');
      const voteMessage = document.getElementById('voteMessage');
      const voteCounts = document.getElementById('voteCounts');
      const voteSelect = document.getElementById('voteSelect');
      const voteNames = {
        no_ai_suspected: tx("认为没有使用 AI"),
        some_ai_suspected: tx("认为部分使用 AI"),
        heavy_ai_suspected: tx("认为大量使用 AI"),
        all_ai_suspected: tx("认为几乎全程使用 AI"),
      };
      function showCounts(counts) {
        if (!voteCounts) return;
        voteCounts.replaceChildren();
        for (const [code, label] of Object.entries(voteNames)) {
          const value = Number(counts?.[code] || 0);
          if (!value) continue;
          const row = document.createElement('div');
          row.textContent = en ? `${value} players ${label}` : `${value} 位玩家${label}`;
          voteCounts.append(row);
        }
      }
      if (voteForm && key) {
        fetch(`/api/feedback?game=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            showCounts(data.counts);
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈功能已启用。");
          })
          .catch(() => {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("匿名反馈暂未启用，等待管理员配置数据库。");
          });
        voteForm.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
          event.preventDefault();
          const vote = voteSelect?.value;
          if (!vote) return;
          const button = voteForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
          if (button) button.disabled = true;
          try {
            const response = await fetch('/api/feedback', {
              method: 'POST',
              headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
              body: JSON.stringify({ game: key, vote }),
            });
            const data = await response.json();
            if (!response.ok) {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = response.status === 409 ? tx("该网络已对本游戏投过票。") : tx("提交失败，请稍后再试。");
              if (data.counts) showCounts(data.counts);
            } else {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈已记录，谢谢参与。");
              showCounts(data.counts);
              voteForm.reset();
            }
          } catch {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("网络错误，请稍后重试。");
          } finally {
            if (button) button.disabled = false;
          }
        });
      }

      const navLinks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.section-nav a'));
      if (navLinks.length && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
        const linksById = new Map(navLinks.map((link) => [link.getAttribute('href')?.slice(1), link]));
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          for (const entry of entries) {
            if (!entry.isIntersecting) continue;
            navLinks.forEach((link) => link.classList.remove('active'));
            linksById.get(entry.target.id)?.classList.add('active');
          }
        }, { rootMargin: '-35% 0px -55% 0px' });
        document.querySelectorAll('section[id]').forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));
      }
    })();
  </script> <script>
    document.getElementById('game-language')?.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
      const slug = document.getElementById('app')?.dataset.slug;
      if (slug) window.location.assign('/games/' + (event.target.value === 'en' ? '' : event.target.value + '/') + encodeURIComponent(slug) + '/' + location.hash);
    });
  </script> </body> </html>